# <%= it.login %> — 技术简历

> 生成时间：<%= it.generatedAt %>

## 概要

<% if (it.topTags && it.topTags.length > 0) { %>
**核心技术方向**：<%= it.topTags.slice(0, 8).join("、") %>
<% } %>
<% if (it.focusRising && it.focusRising.length > 0) { %>
**上升趋势**：<%= it.focusRising.join("、") %>
<% } %>
<% if (it.focusDeclining && it.focusDeclining.length > 0) { %>
**下降趋势**：<%= it.focusDeclining.join("、") %>
<% } %>

## 项目经历

<% for (const entry of it.entries) { %>
### <%= entry.title %> · `<%= entry.repo %>`

**时间**：<%= entry.period.from %> — <%= entry.period.to %>

**技术栈**：<%= entry.stack.join(", ") %>

<% for (const h of entry.highlights) { %>
- <%= h.text %>
<% } %>

<% } %>

## 技术栈总览

<% const allStack = [...new Set(it.entries.flatMap(e => e.stack))]; %>
<%= allStack.join(" · ") %>

## 时间线

<% const sorted = [...it.entries].sort((a, b) => a.period.from.localeCompare(b.period.from)); %>
<% for (const entry of sorted) { %>
- **<%= entry.period.from.slice(0, 7) %>** — <%= entry.title %> (`<%= entry.repo %>`)
<% } %>
